ss=\"flex items-center gap-6 flex-1\"><a class=\"flex items-center gap-2 font-black text-base\" style=\"color:#151015\" href=\"/\"><span class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center text-sm\" style=\"background:rgba(255,255,255,0.96);border:1px solid rgba(93,44,147,0.15)\">🏘️</span><div><span class=\"block leading-none\">Ubuntu Town</span><span class=\"block text-[0.55rem] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em]\" style=\"color:rgba(31,22,32,0.5)\">Abantu Bo Buntu</span></div></a><nav class=\"hidden md:flex items-center gap-5 text-sm font-semibold\" style=\"color:rgba(31,22,32,0.6)\"><a class=\"transition-colors hover:text-[#b98114]\" href=\"/enter\">Enter OS</a><a class=\"transition-colors hover:text-[#b98114]\" href=\"/towns\">Towns</a><a class=\"transition-colors hover:text-[#b98114] flex items-center gap-1\" href=\"/chat\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-sparkles w-3.5 h-3.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M11.017 2.814a1 1 0 0 1 1.966 0l1.051 5.558a2 2 0 0 0 1.594 1.594l5.558 1.051a1 1 0 0 1 0 1.966l-5.558 1.051a2 2 0 0 0-1.594 1.594l-1.051 5.558a1 1 0 0 1-1.966 0l-1.051-5.558a2 2 0 0 0-1.594-1.594l-5.558-1.051a1 1 0 0 1 0-1.966l5.558-1.051a2 2 0 0 0 1.594-1.594z\"></path><path d=\"M20 2v4\"></path><path d=\"M22 4h-4\"></path><circle cx=\"4\" cy=\"20\" r=\"2\"></circle></svg>Kopano AI</a><a class=\"transition-colors hover:text-[#b98114] flex items-center gap-1\" href=\"/cv\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-file-text w-3.5 h-3.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M6 22a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h8a2.4 2.4 0 0 1 1.704.706l3.588 3.588A2.4 2.4 0 0 1 20 8v12a2 2 0 0 1-2 2z\"></path><path d=\"M14 2v5a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h5\"></path><path d=\"M10 9H8\"></path><path d=\"M16 13H8\"></path><path d=\"M16 17H8\"></path></svg>CV Builder</a><a class=\"transition-colors hover:text-[#b98114]\" href=\"/about\">About</a></nav></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><a class=\"text-sm font-semibold px-3 py-1.5\" style=\"color:rgba(31,22,32,0.7)\" href=\"/login\">Sign in</a><a href=\"https://forge.ubuntutown.co.za\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"hidden md:inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3.5 py-2 rounded-xl text-sm font-bold transition-all hover:-translate-y-0.5 border\" style=\"border-color:rgba(238,184,73,0.5);color:#b98114;background:rgba(238,184,73,0.06)\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-hammer w-3.5 h-3.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m15 12-9.373 9.373a1 1 0 0 1-3.001-3L12 9\"></path><path d=\"m18 15 4-4\"></path><path d=\"m21.5 11.5-1.914-1.914A2 2 0 0 1 19 8.172v-.344a2 2 0 0 0-.586-1.414l-1.657-1.657A6 6 0 0 0 12.516 3H9l1.243 1.243A6 6 0 0 1 12 8.485V10l2 2h1.172a2 2 0 0 1 1.414.586L18.5 14.5\"></path></svg>Forge</a><a class=\"hidden md:inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-2.5 rounded-xl text-sm font-black transition-all hover:-translate-y-0.5\" style=\"background:#eeb849;color:#070509\" href=\"/enter\">Enter Town OS</a></div></div></header><main class=\"flex-1\"><div class=\"container mx-auto py-12 space-y-12 max-w-6xl\"><div class=\"text-center space-y-6 py-12\"><div class=\"inline-flex items-center rounded-full border text-xs font-semibold transition-colors focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-ring focus:ring-offset-2 text-foreground px-4 py-1.5\">About Ubuntu Town</div><h1 class=\"scroll-m-20 font-extrabold tracking-tight lg:text-5xl text-4xl sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl\">An initiative of<!-- --> <span class=\"bg-gradient-to-r from-ubuntu-gold to-ubuntu-gold-dark bg-clip-text text-transparent\">Abantu Bo Buntu NPC</span></h1><p class=\"&amp;:not(:first-child):mt-6 mx-auto max-w-[700px] text-lg text-muted-foreground\">Ubuntu Town is a community opportunity network and operating system for South African towns. Founded by Keke Lebaka, it is pillar 01 of Keke&#x27;s work for the agentic economy — built so that both people and AI systems can discover, trust, and act on local opportunity.</p><div class=\"flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-4 pt-4\"><a data-slot=\"button\" class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap text-sm font-medium transition-all disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg:not([class*=&#x27;size-&#x27;])]:size-4 shrink-0 [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 outline-none focus-visible:border-ring focus-visible:ring-ring/50 focus-visible:ring-[3px] aria-invalid:ring-destructive/20 dark:aria-invalid:ring-destructive/40 aria-invalid:border-destructive bg-primary text-primary-foreground hover:bg-primary/90 h-10 rounded-md px-6 has-[&gt;svg]:px-4\" href=\"/enter\">Get Started <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right mr-2 h-5 w-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a><a data-slot=\"button\" class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap text-sm font-medium transition-all disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg:not([class*=&#x27;size-&#x27;])]:size-4 shrink-0 [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 outline-none focus-visible:border-ring focus-visible:ring-ring/50 focus-visible:ring-[3px] aria-invalid:ring-destructive/20 dark:aria-invalid:ring-destructive/40 aria-invalid:border-destructive border bg-background shadow-xs hover:bg-accent hover:text-accent-foreground dark:bg-input/30 dark:border-input dark:hover:bg-input/50 h-10 rounded-md px-6 has-[&gt;svg]:px-4\" href=\"https://kekelebaka.com\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-globe mr-2 h-5 w-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"M12 2a14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0 20 14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0-20\"></path><path d=\"M2 12h20\"></path></svg> Ecosystem context</a></div></div><div class=\"space-y-6\"><div class=\"text-center space-y-2\"><h2 class=\"mt-10 scroll-m-20 pb-2 font-semibold tracking-tight transition-colors first:mt-0 dark:border-b-neutral-700 text-3xl\">Built for Developers</h2><p class=\"leading-7 &amp;:not(:first-child):mt-6 text-muted-foreground\">Everything you need to build production-ready applications</p></div><div class=\"grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3\"><div class=\"rounded-lg border bg-card text-card-foreground shadow-sm\"><div class=\"flex flex-col space-y-1.5 p-6\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><div class=\"flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-primary/10\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-rocket h-6 w-6 text-primary\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 15v5s3.03-.55 4-2c1.08-1.62 0-5 0-5\"></path><path d=\"M4.5 16.5c-1.5 1.26-2 5-2 5s3.74-.5 5-2c.71-.84.7-2.13-.09-2.91a2.18 2.18 0 0 0-2.91-.09\"></path><path d=\"M9 12a22 22 0 0 1 2-3.95A12.88 12.88 0 0 1 22 2c0 2.72-.78 7.5-6 11a22.4 22.4 0 0 1-4 2z\"></path><path d=\"M9 12H4s.55-3.03 2-4c1.62-1.08 5 .05 5 .05\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"text-2xl font-semibold leading-none tracking-tight\">Next.js 14</div></div></div><div class=\"p-6 pt-0\"><div class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground\">Built on the latest Next.js with App Router, Server Components, and Server Actions for optimal performance.</div></div></div><div class=\"rounded-lg border bg-card text-card-foreground shadow-sm\"><div class=\"flex flex-col space-y-1.5 p-6\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><div class=\"flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-chart-2/10\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-database h-6 w-6 text-chart-2\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><ellipse cx=\"12\" cy=\"5\" rx=\"9\" ry=\"3\"></ellipse><path d=\"M3 5V19A9 3 0 0 0 21 19V5\"></path><path d=\"M3 12A9 3 0 0 0 21 12\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"text-2xl font-semibold leading-none tracking-tight\">Supabase</div></div></div><div class=\"p-6 pt-0\"><div class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground\">PostgreSQL database, authentication, real-time subscriptions, and storage - all in one platform.</div></div></div><div class=\"rounded-lg border bg-card text-card-foreground shadow-sm\"><div class=\"flex flex-col space-y-1.5 p-6\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><div class=\"flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-primary/10\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shield h-6 w-6 text-primary\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"text-2xl font-semibold leading-none tracking-tight\">Type-Safe</div></div></div><div class=\"p-6 pt-0\"><div class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground\">Full TypeScript support with type-safe database queries and API routes for confidence in your code.</div></div></div><div class=\"rounded-lg border bg-card text-card-foreground shadow-sm\"><div class=\"flex flex-col space-y-1.5 p-6\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><div class=\"flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-chart-4/10\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-palette h-6 w-6 text-chart-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 22a1 1 0 0 1 0-20 10 9 0 0 1 10 9 5 5 0 0 1-5 5h-2.25a1.75 1.75 0 0 0-1.4 2.8l.3.4a1.75 1.75 0 0 1-1.4 2.8z\"></path><circle cx=\"13.5\" cy=\"6.5\" r=\".5\" fill=\"currentColor\"></circle><circle cx=\"17.5\" cy=\"10.5\" r=\".5\" fill=\"currentColor\"></circle><circle cx=\"6.5\" cy=\"12.5\" r=\".5\" fill=\"currentColor\"></circle><circle cx=\"8.5\" cy=\"7.5\" r=\".5\" fill=\"currentColor\"></circle></svg></div><div class=\"text-2xl font-semibold leading-none tracking-tight\">shadcn/ui</div></div></div><div class=\"p-6 pt-0\"><div class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground\">Beautiful, accessible components built with Radix UI and Tailwind CSS. Customizable and production-ready.</div></div></div><div class=\"rounded-lg border bg-card text-card-foreground shadow-sm\"><div class=\"flex flex-col space-y-1.5 p-6\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><div class=\"flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-chart-1/10\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-lock h-6 w-6 text-chart-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect width=\"18\" height=\"11\" x=\"3\" y=\"11\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"text-2xl font-semibold leading-none tracking-tight\">Authentication</div></div></div><div class=\"p-6 pt-0\"><div class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground\">Complete auth flows including magic links, OAuth providers, password reset, and protected routes.</div></div></div><div class=\"rounded-lg border bg-card text-card-foreground shadow-sm\"><div class=\"flex flex-col space-y-1.5 p-6\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><div class=\"flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-chart-5/10\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-zap h-6 w-6 text-chart-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 14a1 1 0 0 1-.78-1.63l9.9-10.2a.5.5 0 0 1 .86.46l-1.92 6.02A1 1 0 0 0 13 10h7a1 1 0 0 1 .78 1.63l-9.9 10.2a.5.5 0 0 1-.86-.46l1.92-6.02A1 1 0 0 0 11 14z\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"text-2xl font-semibold leading-none tracking-tight\">Developer UX</div></div></div><div class=\"p-6 pt-0\"><div class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground\">Hot reload, TypeScript, ESLint, Prettier, and more. Optimized for the best developer experience.</div></div></div></div></div><div data-slot=\"empty\" class=\"flex min-w-0 flex-1 flex-col items-center justify-center gap-6 text-balance rounded-lg p-6 text-center md:p-12 border-2 border-dashed\"><div data-slot=\"empty-header\" class=\"flex max-w-sm flex-col items-center gap-2 text-center\"><div data-slot=\"empty-icon\" data-variant=\"icon\" class=\"mb-2 [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 bg-muted text-foreground flex size-10 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg [&amp;_svg:not([class*=&#x27;size-&#x27;])]:size-6\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-rocket\" aria-hidden